	(text "J9 and J11 support 3-wire fans only: pin 1 GND, pin 2 independently switched +12 V, pin 3 open-collector tach. Q1/Q2 and Q3/Q4 implement high-side supply PWM; validate PWM, startup, stall, tach, and combined 12 V rail loading on first articles."
